SUMMARY:Flora-Bama Oktoberfest
DESCRIPTION:Flora-Bama throws a family-friendly Oktoberfest each October w
 ith a stein-hoisting contest\, German food while supplies last\, and live
  polka music from The Brats. There is no cover charge\, children are welc
 ome\, and the free drink perk is limited to guests 21 and older. Stein re
 gistration opens at 2:00 PM\, the contest begins at 3:00 PM\, with food a
 nd music following at 4:00 PM.\nPrice: Free\nArea: Pensacola Beach & Perd
 ido\nTimes: Sunday 10/18 · 3:00 PM to 6:00 PM\nChecked against the venue
 's own page on 2026-10-02\nhttps://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-flora-b
 ama-oktoberfest-1011.html
