  JSA is on site to authenticate cards and take submissions\, and food tru
 cks stay all day.\nPrice: Free\nArea: Destin & Fort Walton\nTimes: Sunday
  10/18 · 9:00 AM to 6:00 PM\nChecked against the venue's own page on 202
