SUMMARY:Blue Angels Practice
DESCRIPTION:The Blue Angels fly a Tuesday practice over the National Naval
  Aviation Museum's flight line at NAS Pensacola. The flight-line gates op
 en at 9:30 AM\, the jets are scheduled up at about 10:30 AM\, and watchin
 g costs nothing. The museum is free afterward\, with more than 150 restor
 ed aircraft inside. There is no autograph session on this date\, but the 
 Wednesday 10/28 practice has one. Base entry pauses once the museum lot i
 s full\, so plan to arrive early.\nPrice: Free\nArea: Pensacola\nTimes: T
 uesday 10/20 · gates 9:30 AM\, practice ~10:30 AM\nChecked against the v
 enue's own page on 2026-10-17\nhttps://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-blu
 es-1020.html
